ef Scott Bessent said there had been "successful" talks with China on trade and AI. The talks come amid growing fears that AI could pose an existential threat to humanity.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India news: India's medal tally at Asian games rises to six</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:89e6cd7f7ed2d4d4fbdd47b3e748d2c567d91cc2c60ba60b9859d4dba56ca01c</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-india-s-medal-tally-at-asian-games-rises-to-six/live-79349941--4d2d3c9006df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-india-s-medal-tally-at-asian-games-rises-to-six/live-79349941?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Indian athletes won two bronze and two silver medals on the second day of the Asian Games in Japan. Meanwhile, more bodies were recovered after a flash flood in Kerala. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Japan: Typhoon Dujuan sparks flood, landslide warnings</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:78489a6cb4074f8a9ff9f6ed7482d5eeccdb3af7b0c6b655dd2bbbd8b67b7e0a</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T06:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japan-typhoon-dujuan-sparks-flood-landslide-warnings/a-79349957--3d9e26ef9a38.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/japan-typhoon-dujuan-sparks-flood-landslide-warnings/a-79349957?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Evacuation advisories have been issued and hundreds of flights have been canceled in Japan, which is in the middle of a five-day holiday. The storm could dump record levels of rain on the country.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US: Man wounded in Texas after being shot by ICE agent</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a5dd673e17135f53636613c95f36f2252bfc6e05121bf8a51b18b5e7f29d690e</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T03:42:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-man-wounded-in-texas-after-being-shot-by-ice-agent/a-79349482--51b467c9af48.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-man-wounded-in-texas-after-being-shot-by-ice-agent/a-79349482?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An ICE agent shot and wounded a man in Austin, Texas. The city's mayor has called for an independent investigation into the shooting.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran closes language center in Tehran, France vows response</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:21fdec627cb3980403beb6da473abae3ba14b7f49428992c3330e043512d017f</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T01:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-closes-language-center-in-tehran-france-vows-response/a-79348984--fb202c700849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-closes-language-center-in-tehran-france-vows-response/a-79348984?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In response to the Iranian authorities' decision to close a French language center affiliated with its embassy in Tehran, France vowed to take appropriate measures.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Canada, France agree to closer ties in defense, economy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:120801b829a230b0cc962d4004f6e61c4ff63479c76c5be95b0cf5d2fc53a5ef</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T21:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/canada-france-agree-to-closer-ties-in-defense-economy/a-79348843--81fb213bce0f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/canada-france-agree-to-closer-ties-in-defense-economy/a-79348843?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Amid strained relations with the US, French President Emmanuel Macron and Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney announced closer economic and defense ties.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German state elections deal a blow to Chancellor Friedrich Merz</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7ff88fdad7084b63e39c62d41e5b89841b31d84effcbd175b9a9b7b12708cb6a</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T21:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-state-elections-deal-a-blow-to-chancellor-friedrich-merz/a-79348585--45dd8fc79779.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-state-elections-deal-a-blow-to-chancellor-friedrich-merz/a-79348585?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Elections in Berlin and Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania have dealt the CDU a historic defeat while the AfD saw a massive gain. The pressure on Germany's unpopular chancellor is mounting.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>AfD makes gains in state elections but has no government options</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5ad758eec05f4b86ff2e9f27e05c941b40b259bf76bdce905bf947c528f82fef</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T19:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afd-makes-gains-in-state-elections-but-has-no-government-options/a-79348308--1a6e760f93a8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afd-makes-gains-in-state-elections-but-has-no-government-options/a-79348308?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite making significant gains in both Berlin and Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania, the far-right AfD remains without options to form a state government.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany faces energy tax losses as EV sales rise</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4365181c8e184a739439c8c9632c7a564bf0246f6aaf0bd032b535ef6f432b3e</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T14:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-faces-energy-tax-losses-as-ev-sales-rise/a-79320422--82b05ee44dbb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-faces-energy-tax-losses-as-ev-sales-rise/a-79320422?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The rapid shift to electric vehicles in Germany is cutting fuel tax revenue for the government. As EV sales surge, policymakers face growing pressure to find new ways to fund roads and transportation infrastructure.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Peter Thiel: Power, Palantir and the antichrist</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a5ba43966a741a98ba3826e2929177a9268049960c520112c5b48c7c58604ae7</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:09:48Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T13:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/peter-thiel-power-palantir-and-the-antichrist/a-79313426--884412d8a5b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/peter-thiel-power-palantir-and-the-antichrist/a-79313426?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">He was early to back Facebook, early to back Donald Trump and is one of the world's richest people. But from his theories on the antichrist and AI to his distinctive politics, Peter Thiel is hard to pin down.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
